{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/c259aaec449e7c474859c53caa941bc5.avif?t=1761898375\" width=328 height=88 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sentinel Signal is a software created to help you manage your gaming sessions. Enjoy\u00a0your  games without interfering with your weekly needs and responsibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fosters productivity and life balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shutdown your games as needed. With Sentinel Signal\u00b4s visual and audio built in reminder to stop and save, be aware of the usage of your time and prepare for the end of your sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/dbd2a6f835f2366cf96b4344e5ad3951.poster.avif?t=1761898375\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/dbd2a6f835f2366cf96b4344e5ad3951.webm?t=1761898375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Auto-detect your games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game detection feature allows Sentinel signal to automatically detects your games when they powered up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/ef473038dcf724f55fb60706b567fab0.poster.avif?t=1761898375\" width=638 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/ef473038dcf724f55fb60706b567fab0.webm?t=1761898375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep track of your time used</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your weekly hours of playing time to ensure a healthy dose of gaming. Set weekly goals that fit your lifestyle and track progress toward balanced gaming. View and plan your gaming time ahead.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/15f10a269f5523f09be50a3f34e5c595.poster.avif?t=1761898375\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/15f10a269f5523f09be50a3f34e5c595.webm?t=1761898375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the time wallet feature, save your unused gaming time for later use. <i>You will receive your next day's daily playtime budget every midnight in your Time Wallet and if you don't use them, you can just spend them whenever you like. No more fear of missing out!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/28edd8c1ffc1ed0a7ef396286b1c62a6.avif?t=1761898375\" width=322 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sentinel Signal also gives you the possibility to extend your sessions as needed! The time used comes from your saved unused time in your wallet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/2d4eaee2c6ee041625029e1656ddabe5.poster.avif?t=1761898375\" width=240 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/2d4eaee2c6ee041625029e1656ddabe5.webm?t=1761898375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the time is added through buttons for simplicity and comfort sake, The increments can be adjusted to your liking. You can add or subtract from 5 minutes to 60 minutes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalize to your liking!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;break button&quot; allows you to pause the timer for needed breaks. It allows you to take strategic breaks to rest your eyes, mind and body without losing your flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize the appearance of Sentinel Signal to your desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/34a17d458da75a42e167ae615679649f.poster.avif?t=1761898375\" width=240 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/34a17d458da75a42e167ae615679649f.webm?t=1761898375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/6e993d373061de7f4a4f120cce6fac14.webp?t=1761898375\" width=268 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-</strong> Visual progress tracking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sound indicators</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Games detection (currently only steam games are supported)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flexible time extension and time tracking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Time saving and wallet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic Breaks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Personalization\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/extras/789f11b54af12fea3f103c1b174b9f83.webp?t=1761898375\" width=51 height=34 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Is the game detection feature compatible with games apart from Steam?</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 As of today, we recommend using it only with Steam games, although some other games might be supported. We are unable to provide a list of supported games at this time. If you do encounter any of those we would be grateful of you to notify us of them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Am I be able to customize Sentinel Signal to my tastes?</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 Currently, only Black and White themes are available. We will implement a more intricate personalization feature in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879010?t=1761898375","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879010?t=1761898375","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/775c9127c0adc9219077ff1648a31284ae001e56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761898375","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879010/775c9127c0adc9219077ff1648a31284ae001e56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761898375","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3917560,"description":""}],"detailed